{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a2b5e;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,151,42,.4);padding-bottom:2px;align-self:flex-start;transition:color .2s,border-color .2s}.post-cta[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]:hover{color:#b8972a;border-color:#b8972a}\n</style></head> <body data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <header data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> <nav data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> <a href=\"/\" class=\"logo-wrap\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> <div class=\"logo-mark\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> <img src=\"/tuneincloud.png\" alt=\"TuneInCloud logo\" width=\"64\" height=\"45\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> </div> <div data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> <div class=\"logo-text\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Tune<span data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>in</span>Cloud</div> <span class=\"logo-tagline\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Expertise Microsoft \u00b7 par Daniel Pol\u00f2nio</span> </div> </a> <ul class=\"nav-links\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> <li class=\"has-dropdown\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> <a href=\"/blog/category/actualites\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Actualit\u00e9s</a> <ul class=\"dropdown\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> <li data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2><a href=\"/blog/category/actualites/breves\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Br\u00e8ves</a></li> <li data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2><a href=\"/blog/category/actualites/articles\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Articles</a></li> </ul> </li> <li class=\"has-dropdown\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> <a href=\"/blog/category/guides\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Guides</a> <ul class=\"dropdown\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2> <li data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2><a href=\"/blog/category/guides/entra\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Microsoft Entra</a></li> <li data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2><a href=\"/blog/category/guides/intune\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Microsoft Intune</a></li> <li data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2><a href=\"/blog/category/guides/defender\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Microsoft Defender</a></li> <li data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2><a href=\"/blog/category/guides/purview\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Microsoft Purview</a></li> <li data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2><a href=\"/blog/category/guides/ia\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>IA</a></li> <li data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2><a href=\"/blog/category/guides/autre\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Autre</a></li> </ul> </li> <li data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2><a href=\"/blog/category/dossiers\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>Dossiers</a></li> <li data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2><a href=\"/about\" data-astro-cid-3ef6ksr2>\u00c0 propos</a></li> </ul> </nav> </header> <main data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <!-- HERO --> <section class=\"hero\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class=\"hero-pattern\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <div class=\"hero-content\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class=\"section-label\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Blog technique \u00b7 Expertise Microsoft</span> <h1 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Ma\u00eetrisez<br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><em data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>votre environnement</em><br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Microsoft.</h1> <div class=\"hero-divider\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <p class=\"hero-sub\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Actualit\u00e9s, guides et retours d'exp\u00e9rience sur le Modern Work et la S\u00e9curit\u00e9 dans l'\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me Microsoft \u2014 enti\u00e8rement en fran\u00e7ais.</p> </div> </section> <!-- ARTICLES --> <section class=\"articles-section\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class=\"articles-inner\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class=\"section-label\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Derniers articles</span> <div class=\"divider-gold\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>\u2726</span></div> <div class=\"articles-grid\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <article class=\"post-card\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-10-19-copilot-televersement-agents-avances/\" class=\"post-image-wrap\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src=\"/images/hero/copilot-televersement-agents-avances.webp\" alt=\"Copilot : qui t\u00e9l\u00e9verse des agents avanc\u00e9s ? Choix au 25/10\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> <div class=\"post-body\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class=\"post-meta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <time datetime=\"2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> 19 octobre 2026 </time> </div> <h2 class=\"post-title\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-10-19-copilot-televersement-agents-avances/\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Copilot : qui t\u00e9l\u00e9verse des agents avanc\u00e9s ? Choix au 25/10</a> </h2> <p class=\"post-desc\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Un nouveau param\u00e8tre Copilot restreint le t\u00e9l\u00e9versement d&#39;agents avec actions ou serveur MCP. Sans choix au 25 octobre 2026, il reste ouvert \u00e0 tous.</p> <a href=\"/blog/2026-10-19-copilot-televersement-agents-avances/\" class=\"post-cta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>\nLire l'article\n<svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </a> </div> </article><article class=\"post-card\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-10-12-entra-memberof-groupes-dynamiques/\" class=\"post-image-wrap\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src=\"https://sbd.org.uk/images/entra-directory-enumeration.webp\" alt=\"Entra ID : remplacer les r\u00e8gles memberOf avant le 3 novembre\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> <div class=\"post-body\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class=\"post-meta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <time datetime=\"2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> 12 octobre 2026 </time> </div> <h2 class=\"post-title\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-10-12-entra-memberof-groupes-dynamiques/\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Entra ID : remplacer les r\u00e8gles memberOf avant le 3 novembre</a> </h2> <p class=\"post-desc\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Le 3 novembre 2026, les groupes dynamiques Entra ID bas\u00e9s sur memberOf se figent. Inventaire Graph, d\u00e9pendances CA, licences et Intune, remplacement, contr\u00f4le.</p> <a href=\"/blog/2026-10-12-entra-memberof-groupes-dynamiques/\" class=\"post-cta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>\nLire l'article\n<svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </a> </div> </article><article class=\"post-card\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-10-08-intune-baseline-windows-11-26h2/\" class=\"post-image-wrap\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src=\"/images/hero/2026-10-07-intune-baseline-windows-11-26h2.webp\" alt=\"Intune : baseline de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 Windows 11 26H2 disponible\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> <div class=\"post-body\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class=\"post-meta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <time datetime=\"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> 8 octobre 2026 </time> </div> <h2 class=\"post-title\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-10-08-intune-baseline-windows-11-26h2/\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Intune : baseline de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 Windows 11 26H2 disponible</a> </h2> <p class=\"post-desc\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Depuis le 6 octobre 2026, Intune propose la baseline de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 Windows 11 26H2. Deux changements r\u00e9els, un r\u00e9glage absent, et une mise \u00e0 niveau manuelle.</p> <a href=\"/blog/2026-10-08-intune-baseline-windows-11-26h2/\" class=\"post-cta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>\nLire l'article\n<svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </a> </div> </article><article class=\"post-card\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-07-20-purview-entrainternetaccess/\" class=\"post-image-wrap\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/workingtogether.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/wn.png?fit=1200%2C800&#38;ssl=1\" alt=\"Purview \u00e9tend la DLP au niveau r\u00e9seau via Entra Internet Access\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> <div class=\"post-body\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class=\"post-meta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <time datetime=\"2026-07-20T00:00:00.000Z\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> 20 juillet 2026 </time> </div> <h2 class=\"post-title\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-07-20-purview-entrainternetaccess/\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Purview \u00e9tend la DLP au niveau r\u00e9seau via Entra Internet Access</a> </h2> <p class=\"post-desc\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Microsoft Purview inspecte d\u00e9sormais le trafic r\u00e9seau via Entra Internet Access : prompts IA, uploads vers le cloud personnel, webmails. Public Preview en cours, GA attendue entre fin septembre et fin octobre 2026.</p> <a href=\"/blog/2026-07-20-purview-entrainternetaccess/\" class=\"post-cta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>\nLire l'article\n<svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </a> </div> </article><article class=\"post-card\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-07-08-dossier-dspm/\" class=\"post-image-wrap\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xr5DGzAs4no/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEhCK4FEIIDSFryq4qpAxMIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJD&#38;rs=AOn4CLC9pReDIU7l4TIkm9Xdl8yhGnDogw\" alt=\"Microsoft Purview DSPM : le nouveau plan de contr\u00f4le unifi\u00e9 pour la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 des donn\u00e9es\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> <div class=\"post-body\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class=\"post-meta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <time datetime=\"2026-07-08T00:00:00.000Z\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> 8 juillet 2026 </time> </div> <h2 class=\"post-title\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-07-08-dossier-dspm/\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Microsoft Purview DSPM : le nouveau plan de contr\u00f4le unifi\u00e9 pour la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 des donn\u00e9es</a> </h2> <p class=\"post-desc\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Le nouveau DSPM Purview fusionne DSPM classic et DSPM for AI en une exp\u00e9rience unifi\u00e9e, GA depuis fin mai 2026. Architecture, cas d&#39;usage, licences, limites et compte \u00e0 rebours vers septembre 2026.</p> <a href=\"/blog/2026-07-08-dossier-dspm/\" class=\"post-cta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>\nLire l'article\n<svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </a> </div> </article><article class=\"post-card\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-05-18-sso-linux-macos/\" class=\"post-image-wrap\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src=\"https://www.ordunix.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/linux_security_vs_macos_and_windows_locks_data_thinkstock-100748607-orig.webp\" alt=\"SSO macOS et Linux dans Intune : Une vraie avanc\u00e9e sur les deux syst\u00e8mes\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> <div class=\"post-body\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class=\"post-meta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <time datetime=\"2026-05-19T00:00:00.000Z\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> 19 mai 2026 </time> </div> <h2 class=\"post-title\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/2026-05-18-sso-linux-macos/\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>SSO macOS et Linux dans Intune : Une vraie avanc\u00e9e sur les deux syst\u00e8mes</a> </h2> <p class=\"post-desc\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Avril et mai 2026 marquent un alignement net du SSO macOS et Linux sur ce qu&#39;Intune propose c\u00f4t\u00e9 Windows. Platform SSO pendant Setup Assistant en GA pour macOS, PRMFA disponible sur Linux via le Microsoft Identity Broker. Le multi-OS manag\u00e9 devient une vraie possibilit\u00e9, plus une promesse.</p> <a href=\"/blog/2026-05-18-sso-linux-macos/\" class=\"post-cta\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>\nLire l'article\n<svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </a> </div> </article> </div> </div> </section> </main> <footer data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <div class=\"footer-inner\" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <div class=\"footer-logo\" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte>Tune<span data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte>in</span>Cloud</div> <p class=\"footer-tagline\" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte>Blog Expertise Microsoft \u00b7 par Daniel Pol\u00f2nio</p> <p class=\"footer-copy\" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte>\u00a9 2026 TuneInCloud \u2014 Tous droits r\u00e9serv\u00e9s</p> </div> </footer></body></html>",
